          <groundspeak:finder id="2500583">Count Smiley</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP373 Neutral Valley

The cap was a quick find but I stayed to admire this extremely well kept farm out at the end of this road.  It almost looked out of place given the location on the prairie and was more in line with an acreage near a city.   Thanks for the adventure.&lt;/p&gt;

