          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP373 Neutral Valley

The freshly graded road made this a relatively smooth drive back to the cap.  Found the cap under the remnants of the wooden survey stakes.   TFTCap&lt;/p&gt;

