          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP373 - Neutral Valley&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Found on our road trip returning from Meadow Lake Saskatchewan to Southern Alberta.

This was a pleasant rural diversion along the way.

Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;

